# Local Worker dev overrides for `wrangler dev` (copy to `.dev.vars`).
#
# Vibo has NO app-level API credentials — each user's own Vibo email + password
# arrive through the connector's OAuth login form (served at /authorize), not
# from here. There is nothing required in this file to run the hosted connector
# locally; it exists only as the conventional place for any future Worker-only
# dev override.
